abstract: >
  AutoTAB is an automated algorithm for tracking bipolar magnetic regions (BMRs) on the Sun
  using MDI and HMI data spanning 1996 to 2020. It enables large-scale studies of BMR evolution,
  tilt, magnetic flux, and their role in solar magnetic activity.
keywords:
  - solar magnetism
  - active regions
  - magnetic flux
  - sunspot tracking
